WEBVTT

00:04.398 --> 00:05.194
Sui...

00:07.968 --> 00:09.265
Are you Sui?

00:10.470 --> 00:11.630
You finally...

00:14.107 --> 00:16.632
...remembered.

00:20.147 --> 00:21.273
Where?!

00:21.348 --> 00:22.838
Where is Ruri?!

00:23.183 --> 00:25.344
At the top of Tower Gate!

01:06.993 --> 01:09.461
Thank you for coming down,
Mr. Seki.

01:09.930 --> 01:13.696
I've also heard there's been
some trouble at headquarters.

01:13.900 --> 01:15.868
That matter has been dealt with.

01:16.169 --> 01:18.501
Is the culprit at Tower Gate?

01:19.072 --> 01:19.902
We don't know.

01:20.307 --> 01:24.300
We shut down all access to Tower Gate
as soon as the problems began.

01:24.678 --> 01:27.579
But since it takes some time
to seal it off...

01:27.647 --> 01:30.013
...there is a possibility that
the culprit might've escaped.

01:33.019 --> 01:35.715
We've set up barricades
throughout town...

01:35.789 --> 01:38.121
...and we're questioning
suspicious looking characters.

01:38.625 --> 01:40.820
Continue the search.

01:42.763 --> 01:43.889
S-Sergeant!

01:44.564 --> 01:45.087
What's the matter?!

01:45.632 --> 01:47.930
Who are you?!

01:48.435 --> 01:50.869
You're completely surrounded!

01:51.271 --> 01:52.636
Step out of there calmly!

01:54.608 --> 01:58.635
Before I do that, why don't you
put down those weapons?

02:00.213 --> 02:02.704
Put your hands up and come out!

02:03.083 --> 02:06.075
I appreciate you dealing with this
by the book...

02:06.153 --> 02:08.348
...but you haven't correctly
assessed the situation!

02:10.957 --> 02:11.719
Get back!

02:11.792 --> 02:12.759
Mr. Seki.

02:13.693 --> 02:16.025
I know this man very well.

02:18.098 --> 02:20.259
What are you doing here?

02:23.236 --> 02:23.670
- Pairon?!

02:23.670 --> 02:24.694
- Pairon?!
- It's Pairon!

03:00.273 --> 03:05.370
HEY YOU!
Shiraketa kao de nageite iru dake ja

03:06.213 --> 03:11.150
tabun nani mo hajimara nai
nige wa shinaide

03:11.785 --> 03:17.883
hashiri dashite iru mirai ga
aruno nara

03:18.058 --> 03:23.997
fukaku ochi konderu
hima wa nai

03:24.197 --> 03:30.500
hito wa sou daremo ga
toki to shite mayoi

03:30.570 --> 03:36.440
atae rareta hibi wo
tada ikite iru kedo

03:36.510 --> 03:42.642
ushinatte wa nara nai mono

03:42.716 --> 03:48.746
kakaete mamotte kizu tsuite

03:48.822 --> 03:54.988
sore demo mata aruki daseru

03:55.061 --> 04:01.864
chikara wo shinji teru yo

04:09.142 --> 04:12.579
Wind Blowing Away the Tears
Wind Blowing Away the Tears.

04:12.579 --> 04:16.106
Wind Blowing Away the Tears

04:23.490 --> 04:26.857
Uh, there's really nothing
suspicious about me...

04:26.927 --> 04:27.916
Look!

04:27.994 --> 04:30.588
You were found on the street
encased in ice!

04:38.772 --> 04:40.865
I'd say that's pretty suspicious.

04:42.475 --> 04:43.533
I suppose.

04:44.077 --> 04:45.203
Take her to HQ!

04:45.645 --> 04:47.704
We're going to get
to the bottom of this!

04:47.914 --> 04:49.006
Now, get up!

04:58.959 --> 05:01.951
I hope you've noticed,
Master Pairon.

05:02.796 --> 05:06.357
So, you say that a section
of the bridge collapsed...

05:06.433 --> 05:08.424
...as you passed by...

05:08.501 --> 05:11.629
...and that you entered in order to
pursue the culprit.

05:13.073 --> 05:14.267
That's right.

05:14.474 --> 05:15.771
So, where is the culprit?

05:16.743 --> 05:19.177
Unfortunately, he got away.

05:20.080 --> 05:22.640
So there's no one here anymore?

05:23.717 --> 05:27.016
You're free to believe
what you want.

05:34.494 --> 05:35.426
Where are you going?

05:36.630 --> 05:38.825
I forgot something up top.

05:40.467 --> 05:41.934
You want to come with me?

05:47.140 --> 05:48.232
It's secure here.

05:48.308 --> 05:49.138
Look elsewhere!

05:49.342 --> 05:50.036
Yes, sir!

05:59.185 --> 06:02.313
So the princess is locked up...

06:02.389 --> 06:04.789
...high on top of this tower.

06:17.103 --> 06:17.967
Ruri...

06:21.641 --> 06:22.699
Finally...

06:27.147 --> 06:28.205
Oh, no...

06:30.016 --> 06:32.507
I don't know what to say.

06:35.021 --> 06:37.717
Your hair's gotten longer.

06:38.258 --> 06:41.284
Huh? You think?

06:41.795 --> 06:42.887
Yeah.

06:43.630 --> 06:44.790
Just a little.

06:45.965 --> 06:46.863
Ruri...

06:47.934 --> 06:52.132
Th-Then, maybe I should've
gone to the barber's first.

06:52.806 --> 06:55.639
What if I tie my hair back?

06:58.311 --> 07:00.279
Or, how about like this?

07:00.780 --> 07:01.610
Or like this?

07:02.749 --> 07:04.478
What the hell am I doing?!

07:07.320 --> 07:08.981
I've got to keep talking.

07:09.055 --> 07:10.283
Keep talking.

07:10.724 --> 07:13.022
I've got tons of things to do!

07:13.426 --> 07:14.324
You're funny.

07:17.731 --> 07:20.495
I'm so happy right now...

07:20.567 --> 07:23.127
...but I can't stop my tears.

07:25.105 --> 07:26.766
Then...

07:28.174 --> 07:30.108
...I'll blow it away with my wind.

07:31.444 --> 07:33.071
The tears...

07:33.146 --> 07:34.511
...and the sadness!

07:34.781 --> 07:35.748
Rumina...

07:41.287 --> 07:42.811
Look, Rumina.

07:43.256 --> 07:43.779
Huh?

07:48.528 --> 07:51.554
It looks just like that starry sky
we saw that night.

08:02.742 --> 08:05.370
Let's go up to the surface!

08:06.880 --> 08:09.747
I'll show you a real starry night.

08:11.985 --> 08:12.781
Okay!

08:20.760 --> 08:21.727
Over here!

08:21.795 --> 08:23.023
This way!

08:23.530 --> 08:25.589
He's completely unconscious.

08:26.666 --> 08:27.394
All right!

08:27.467 --> 08:29.833
Put him in cuffs and carefully
take him away.

08:29.903 --> 08:30.528
Yes, sir.

08:36.042 --> 08:37.509
Take him in to HQ immediately.

08:37.577 --> 08:38.305
Yes, sir!

08:42.549 --> 08:44.210
They finally left.

08:44.551 --> 08:48.419
Chelsea must've beat up that guy.

08:48.721 --> 08:50.655
There's no one at the hotel.

08:50.723 --> 08:53.123
I wonder where everyone went?

08:53.259 --> 08:54.283
Hey, you!

08:55.161 --> 08:58.153
Uh, I've done nothing wrong...

08:58.565 --> 09:00.260
You look suspicious to me!

09:02.535 --> 09:04.196
Jilherts!

09:04.270 --> 09:06.033
I've been looking for you guys!

09:06.105 --> 09:08.767
Rumina takes off
into the Tower...

09:08.842 --> 09:10.139
...and I get attacked by...

09:10.210 --> 09:11.177
Shut up!

09:11.377 --> 09:13.106
I've had a tough time, too!

09:13.179 --> 09:14.578
- Where's Chelsea?
- Where's Miss Rorec?

09:14.781 --> 09:15.338
Huh?

09:22.956 --> 09:26.619
They're not going to
make it easy for me, are they?

09:26.826 --> 09:27.520
Hey!

09:27.594 --> 09:28.925
What are you doing there?!

09:31.798 --> 09:34.028
Is that Company HQ uniform?

09:34.934 --> 09:35.992
Excuse us!

09:36.669 --> 09:39.137
We're on emergency alert
right now.

09:39.439 --> 09:42.499
Excuse me,
but may I see your identification?

09:43.109 --> 09:44.133
You insist?

09:46.145 --> 09:49.672
How about you keep quiet
and get me into the Tower Gate.

09:50.216 --> 09:51.046
You are...!

09:51.251 --> 09:52.411
Chelsea Rorec!

09:53.353 --> 09:54.149
Hold it!

09:54.287 --> 09:56.949
It's the traitor Chelsea Rorec!
Get her!

09:58.091 --> 09:59.058
Fire!

10:00.660 --> 10:01.558
Rubber bullets...

10:01.628 --> 10:03.528
Those things really hurt!

10:05.465 --> 10:08.059
I guess I can't just charge in.

10:19.646 --> 10:21.136
How about now?

10:27.220 --> 10:29.450
It's moving, Rumina!

10:30.023 --> 10:31.820
All right! I did it!

10:32.225 --> 10:34.750
Too bad this side's damaged.

10:37.330 --> 10:39.764
No sense crying about something
we don't have.

10:39.832 --> 10:42.357
If we can narrow the gap
by half...

10:42.435 --> 10:45.461
...I can easily get over there
with the power of the wind.

10:46.272 --> 10:47.204
Hang in there!

10:47.974 --> 10:48.770
Rumina...

10:53.780 --> 10:54.678
I'm coming!

11:00.320 --> 11:01.150
Rumina!

11:05.525 --> 11:07.117
Wh-What...?!

11:11.631 --> 11:14.930
This overwhelming feeling
I'm getting...

11:15.635 --> 11:17.830
It's powerful.

11:19.305 --> 11:22.069
Seems you've improved
your skills a little.

11:27.080 --> 11:28.638
You're Pairon!

11:44.731 --> 11:47.393
I wonder if Rumina defeated
him?

11:54.407 --> 11:56.102
The bridge is moving.

12:00.847 --> 12:02.474
I haven't forgotten.

12:04.183 --> 12:05.775
If there's one person...!

12:07.020 --> 12:07.987
Pairon!

12:11.724 --> 12:14.693
It's been a while, kid.

12:27.740 --> 12:29.469
Damn!

12:29.542 --> 12:32.568
Nothing good's been happening
since I beat up that idiot.

12:37.850 --> 12:39.647
Is something the matter?

12:39.719 --> 12:40.708
Yeah.

12:41.054 --> 12:44.512
Ever since I got in a fight
with this guy on my first day...

12:44.590 --> 12:49.323
...everyone thinks I'm a dangerous
guy that ought to be avoided.

12:50.196 --> 12:51.595
What a misunderstanding.

12:51.931 --> 12:52.420
Huh?

12:52.498 --> 12:54.398
You're a very nice person.

12:55.134 --> 12:57.500
After all, you've been letting us
stay here...

12:57.570 --> 12:59.663
...when we have nowhere to go.

13:00.540 --> 13:01.598
Isn't that right?

13:05.611 --> 13:07.636
That's exactly right!

13:07.847 --> 13:12.443
I'm such a great guy,
but no one seems to understand!

13:14.654 --> 13:15.678
Rumina!

13:17.690 --> 13:20.784
You sure are a sneaky bastard!

13:22.528 --> 13:23.756
Hey, wait!

13:23.996 --> 13:24.963
You've got it wrong!

13:25.431 --> 13:26.625
Forget your excuses!

13:27.133 --> 13:31.365
I thought that my rose-colored life
would continue on...

13:31.437 --> 13:35.339
...like a puffy cloud
floating across the sunny sky.

13:36.142 --> 13:38.201
Until he arrived, that is!

13:39.445 --> 13:40.571
Rumina...

13:40.646 --> 13:41.408
Ruri!

13:46.853 --> 13:50.653
Don't make it so hard on me,
Maiden of Life.

13:51.791 --> 13:53.986
What happened to...

13:54.060 --> 13:55.755
What happened to Shiel?

13:56.996 --> 14:00.955
Given that I'm standing
right here...

14:01.033 --> 14:03.365
...you can probably take
a good guess...

14:22.555 --> 14:24.022
Why, you!

14:24.624 --> 14:27.718
I don't intend on
dealing with you now.

14:28.261 --> 14:32.163
I must take the princess
to the castle, after all.

14:34.433 --> 14:36.424
Give my regards to Rorec.

14:38.871 --> 14:39.838
Hold it!

14:41.707 --> 14:45.268
I don't care if you're heading
back to the Company...

14:45.344 --> 14:47.141
...but I made a promise to Ruri.

14:48.781 --> 14:51.409
I promised her I'd show her
a starry night sky again!

14:56.656 --> 14:57.486
Don't let up!

14:58.024 --> 14:58.956
Keep at it!

15:05.398 --> 15:06.228
What?!

15:08.234 --> 15:10.998
Is this what they call
the power of gravity?!

15:14.774 --> 15:18.005
Chelsea Rorec is making her way
through the Second District!

15:19.879 --> 15:20.573
Ruri!

15:23.583 --> 15:25.847
She's escaping into
the residential districts!

15:26.185 --> 15:29.586
It's through here the traitor intends
to penetrate the Tower Gate!

15:30.089 --> 15:32.557
Reinforce dragnet
in the Second District!

15:32.625 --> 15:34.092
We must apprehend her!

15:35.027 --> 15:36.517
Mr. Seki?

15:36.762 --> 15:40.459
I had a feeling Chelsea had
something to do with this.

15:44.003 --> 15:45.027
Why did the bridge...?

15:45.738 --> 15:48.468
The power of wind, was it?

15:49.842 --> 15:53.278
I can tell by the feeling
I get from the air.

15:53.346 --> 15:55.507
You've made
quite an improvement.

15:55.848 --> 15:57.475
Have you ever wondered...

15:57.917 --> 16:02.877
...why a surface dweller like you
is able to use a power like that?

16:03.456 --> 16:03.979
Huh?

16:05.858 --> 16:10.591
You were reborn with the Maiden
of Life's power of resurrection.

16:10.730 --> 16:12.288
Wh-What are you talking about?!

16:13.766 --> 16:15.427
Think about it.

16:16.235 --> 16:19.671
How was life created
in this world to begin with?

16:20.640 --> 16:21.800
Fire...

16:21.874 --> 16:23.432
Wind...

16:23.509 --> 16:24.840
Water...

16:24.910 --> 16:25.808
Earth...

16:26.178 --> 16:27.372
Gravity...

16:27.813 --> 16:31.214
All of those elements
existing in nature...

16:31.284 --> 16:34.219
...came together
in a miraculous balance...

16:34.887 --> 16:36.650
...and life was created.

16:37.623 --> 16:38.487
That's right.

16:38.758 --> 16:42.421
The Maiden is the crystallization
of all of those elements.

16:43.129 --> 16:47.589
Each of the elements
is a mere fraction of her power.

16:47.967 --> 16:53.098
Even your power of wind was
granted to you by the Maiden.

16:56.075 --> 16:57.099
Do you understand?

16:57.510 --> 17:01.105
The Maiden of Life is
the ultimate prize...

17:01.180 --> 17:03.910
...that the scientists
have been searching for.

17:04.617 --> 17:07.882
She's not one the likes of you
can make off with.

17:07.953 --> 17:09.181
So what about it?

17:11.590 --> 17:13.319
I made Ruri a promise!

17:14.327 --> 17:16.557
Now, what's wrong with me
trying to keep that promise?!

17:18.030 --> 17:18.962
Rumina...

17:24.637 --> 17:26.366
Asagi Swordsmanship!

17:26.839 --> 17:28.670
Wind Storm!

17:29.675 --> 17:31.802
What a foolish kid.

17:32.611 --> 17:33.373
No!

17:37.116 --> 17:37.775
What?!

17:40.686 --> 17:41.618
Rumina!

17:46.759 --> 17:50.217
His resistance was pointless.
Wasn't it, Maiden of Life?

17:50.396 --> 17:51.454
No...

17:51.997 --> 17:56.798
If he had done what he was told,
he would've lived a long life.

18:09.382 --> 18:12.476
I would've what?
If I did what I was told?

18:12.852 --> 18:13.750
Rumina!

18:14.453 --> 18:19.186
The fact that you avoided my
attack, and even defeated Teil...

18:19.258 --> 18:21.453
...I suppose those were not flukes.

18:28.467 --> 18:31.800
I held back because
you've got Ruri there.

18:32.304 --> 18:36.434
My whole body is ordinarily
shielded by a barrier of water.

18:37.042 --> 18:41.911
To think one could injure me,
let alone even touch me...

18:43.015 --> 18:44.448
Not since then.

18:46.819 --> 18:47.513
Ruri!

18:48.421 --> 18:50.082
Hey!
What do you think you're doing?!

18:52.658 --> 18:56.025
I'm going to show you
some manners, kid!

19:00.566 --> 19:02.557
If I could just get in through there!

19:06.872 --> 19:08.396
Wh-What is this?

19:08.974 --> 19:11.135
It's been a while, Chelsea.

19:12.778 --> 19:13.506
Seki!

19:20.453 --> 19:21.477
Fire!

19:36.235 --> 19:37.259
Ruri...!

19:50.950 --> 19:51.939
You!

19:52.017 --> 19:54.679
You can see through my attack?!

19:54.854 --> 19:56.685
Yeah, you could say that.

19:57.423 --> 19:59.152
I can't see it.

19:59.592 --> 20:03.790
Even based on wind vibrations,
I can barely tell where it's coming
from.

20:06.732 --> 20:07.596
Rumina...

20:08.200 --> 20:09.292
Master Pairon?!

20:10.202 --> 20:11.226
Stay back!

20:20.112 --> 20:22.342
R-Rumina...!

20:30.456 --> 20:33.789
No!

20:44.436 --> 20:49.135
Kyoumo uso no youni

20:49.208 --> 20:55.147
migakareru machi nami wo

20:55.214 --> 21:07.490
mokuteki ga aruyou ni
aruku boku

21:08.527 --> 21:19.301
naiteruno?
Honno sasayaka na kakotachi yo

21:19.371 --> 21:31.010
miagereba
DIGITAL no SCREEN ni sora ga...

21:31.684 --> 21:40.558
kaze no uta wo
takai kaidan wo nobori

21:40.626 --> 21:44.392
kikou to shita

21:44.463 --> 21:52.598
daite
amaku kizu tsuita yume ga mou

21:52.671 --> 22:01.477
same temo ii
nakanaide

22:10.456 --> 22:12.356
Preview

22:12.691 --> 22:14.682
Show her the stars?

22:14.760 --> 22:17.092
Blow away her sadness and tears?

22:17.429 --> 22:21.024
Didn't I come all this way
in order to take Ruri back?!

22:21.433 --> 22:24.402
But I'm going to die
before her eyes.

22:24.470 --> 22:25.630
How pathetic!

22:26.005 --> 22:28.633
I have to keep my promise
to Ruri!

22:28.807 --> 22:30.934
I can't stop until I do!

22:31.443 --> 22:33.604
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:33.679 --> 22:36.015
..."Frustration - Unfulfilled Desire."

22:36.015 --> 22:40.315
Frustration - Unfulfilled Desire
